{'symbol': 'RF', 'date': '2022-10-04 09:00:00', 'title': 'REBUILDING. RECOVERING.', 'text': 'FORT MYERS, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #FLWX--REGIONS BANK ON TUESDAY ANNOUNCED A SERIES OF FINANCIAL SERVICES TO HELP PEOPLE AND BUSINESSES IMPACTED BY HURRICANE IAN. IN ADDITION, THE REGIONS FOUNDATION, A NONPROFIT INITIATIVE FUNDED PRIMARILY BY REGIONS BANK, ANNOUNCED A COMMITMENT OF $225,000 IN GRANT FUNDING FOR ORGANIZATIONS PROVIDING DISASTER RELIEF. COMMUNITY RECOVERY: THE $225,000 TOTAL IN GRANT FUNDING FROM THE REGIONS FOUNDATION WILL BE DIVIDED AMONG SEVERAL AGENCIES MEETING SHORT- AND LONG-TERM'}